#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:1
msgid "Configuration and Parameters"
msgstr "配置与参数"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:3
msgid "RELIC separates structural configuration from scientific parameter values. `RELICConfig` validates subsystem structure across 15 Pydantic V2 `BaseModel` classes in `relic.core.config.models` (base `ConfigurationModel`, root `RELICConfig` at schema `2.0.0`, 10 subsystem configuration models, and 3 nested `DataConfig` sub-models `DataIOConfig`, `DataQualityConfig`, and `DataTransformConfig`, totaling 13 subsystem and nested models beneath `RELICConfig`), while `UnifiedParameterManager` serves as the Single Source of Truth (SSOT) for versioned scientific values and metadata. `RELICSimulator` consumes a runtime mapping and is not a direct consumer of a `RELICConfig` object."
msgstr "RELIC 将结构化配置与科学参数值分离。`RELICConfig` 基于 `relic.core.config.models` 中的 15 个 Pydantic V2 `BaseModel` 类校验子系统结构（包括基类 `ConfigurationModel`、架构版本 `2.0.0` 的根模型 `RELICConfig`、10 个子系统配置模型，以及 `DataConfig` 下属的 3 个嵌套子模型 `DataIOConfig`、`DataQualityConfig` 与 `DataTransformConfig`，即 `RELICConfig` 下辖共计 13 个子系统及嵌套模型）；`UnifiedParameterManager` 则作为版本化科学参数值与元数据的单点事实源（Single Source of Truth, SSOT）。`RELICSimulator` 接收运行时映射，不直接消费 `RELICConfig` 对象。"

