#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:104
msgid "`ConfigLoader` and `load_config`"
msgstr "`ConfigLoader`和`load_config`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`ConfigLoader.load_config(config_path=None, overrides=None, env_overrides=True)` is the single configuration load path. It reads the file as UTF-8, applies the dotted overrides, applies environment overrides when `env_overrides` is true, builds `RELICConfig`, writes `parameters.parameter_overrides` to the ParameterManager (with bounds validation), and runs `ConfigValidator`. `overrides` is a mapping such as `{\"simulation.time_step\": 1800.0}` or a list of `\"dotted.key=value\"` strings; an item without `=` raises. An environment variable is read only when its name is `RELIC_` plus the upper-case path of a `RELICConfig` field joined with `\"_\"` characters, for example `RELIC_SIMULATION_TIME_STEP` for `simulation.time_step`; other `RELIC_*` variables are not configuration. The module-level `load_config(config_path=None, overrides=None, validate=True)` uses `ConfigLoader(validate_on_load=validate)`; `validate=False` is the only way to skip `ConfigValidator`. `ConfigValidator` accepts enum fields given as strings in YAML, such as `integration_method: \"euler\"`."
msgstr "`ConfigLoader.load_config(config_path=None, overrides=None, env_overrides=True)` 是唯一配置加载路径。该方法以 UTF-8 编码读取配置文件，应用点分路径覆盖项，在 `env_overrides` 为真时应用环境变量覆盖，构建 `RELICConfig`，将 `parameters.parameter_overrides` 写入参数管理器（ParameterManager）并执行边界校验，随后运行 `ConfigValidator`。`overrides` 可为映射（如 `{\"simulation.time_step\": 1800.0}`）或 `\"dotted.key=value\"` 字符串列表；列表元素缺少 `=` 时直接抛出异常。环境变量仅在名称满足“`RELIC_` 前缀加 `RELICConfig` 字段路径大写并以 `\"_\"` 连接”时才会被读取，例如 `simulation.time_step` 对应 `RELIC_SIMULATION_TIME_STEP`；其余 `RELIC_*` 变量不属于配置项。模块级函数 `load_config(config_path=None, overrides=None, validate=True)` 内部调用 `ConfigLoader(validate_on_load=validate)`；仅传入 `validate=False` 可跳过 `ConfigValidator`。`ConfigValidator` 支持在 YAML 中以字符串形式指定枚举字段，例如 `integration_method: \"euler\"`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:138
msgid "A named configuration (the `config_path` argument, else `RELIC_CONFIG_PATH`) that does not exist raises `FileNotFoundError`. Without a named configuration the first existing file of `relic.core.config.loader.DEFAULT_CONFIG_PATHS` is read, and when none exists the global default configuration (`RELICConfig` defaults, with overrides and environment overrides applied) is used and the choice is logged; `relic.core.config.resolve_config_source` is this one rule for `ConfigLoader`, `get_global_config` and `load_runtime_config`. Every other load failure raises `relic.core.config.loader.ConfigurationError`, with the original exception as `__cause__` where there is one: an unsupported suffix, invalid YAML, a model-validation error, a malformed override, a `parameter_overrides` key that is not a registered parameter, and `ConfigValidator` errors."
msgstr "指定的配置（优先采用 `config_path` 参数，否则采用 `RELIC_CONFIG_PATH`）不存在时，抛出 `FileNotFoundError`。没有指定配置时，读取 `relic.core.config.loader.DEFAULT_CONFIG_PATHS` 中第一个存在的文件；都不存在时，使用全局默认配置（`RELICConfig` 的默认值，应用显式覆盖和环境覆盖）并记录该选择；`relic.core.config.resolve_config_source` 是 `ConfigLoader`、`get_global_config` 和 `load_runtime_config` 共用的唯一规则。其他所有加载失败都抛出 `relic.core.config.loader.ConfigurationError`，存在原始异常时将其设为 `__cause__`：包括不支持的后缀、无效 YAML、模型验证错误、格式错误的覆盖、不是已注册参数的 `parameter_overrides` 键，以及 `ConfigValidator` 错误。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:151
msgid "Runtime configuration mapping"
msgstr "Runtime配置映射"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:153
msgid "`RELICSimulator` reads a Python mapping with `.get()`. Do not pass a `RELICConfig` instance directly. Map typed settings to the runtime key names:"
msgstr "`RELICSimulator` 读取一个Python映射，使用`.get()`。不要直接传递`RELICConfig`实例。将类型化的设置映射到runtime键名："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md:172
msgid "Runtime keys may be placed at the mapping root or under a `simulator`, `runtime`, or `computation` section. `RELICSimulator` reads each key from the root first and otherwise from the first of these sections, in that order, that contains it; `device` and `require_gpu` use the same lookup. The `device_overrides` and `module_device_overrides` mappings are merged in the order root, `simulator`, `runtime`, `computation`; the later entry wins for the same name. `SimulationConfig` has no `output_frequency` or checkpoint field, so these runtime keys are given explicitly. It declares no adaptive-step field either: adaptive stepping is configured by the runtime keys `adaptive_dt_enabled`, `adaptive_atol`, `adaptive_rtol`, `adaptive_dt_min` and `adaptive_dt_max`, whose defaults are the `computation.scheduling.adaptive.*` parameters. Its `end_time` defaults to one day and its `time_step` must not exceed one hour (`SECONDS_PER_DAY` and `SECONDS_PER_HOUR` of `relic.utils.time_constants`). The simulator does not rename typed fields such as `simulation.end_time` to `max_time` or `simulation.integration_method` to `time_integration_method`."
msgstr "运行时键可置于映射根部，或置于 `simulator`、`runtime`、`computation` 节下。`RELICSimulator` 优先从根部读取各键，未命中时按上述顺序从首个包含该键的分节读取；`device` 与 `require_gpu` 遵循同一查找顺序。`device_overrides` 与 `module_device_overrides` 映射按根部、`simulator`、`runtime`、`computation` 的顺序合并，同名项以后出现者为准。`SimulationConfig` 不含 `output_frequency` 或检查点字段，此类运行时键需显式传入；该模型同样未声明自适应步长字段，自适应步进由运行时键 `adaptive_dt_enabled`、`adaptive_atol`、`adaptive_rtol`、`adaptive_dt_min` 与 `adaptive_dt_max` 配置，默认值取自 `computation.scheduling.adaptive.*` 参数。`end_time` 默认为 1 天，`time_step` 不得超过 1 小时（对应 `relic.utils.time_constants` 中的 `SECONDS_PER_DAY` 与 `SECONDS_PER_HOUR`）。模拟器不会将 `simulation.end_time` 这类类型化字段重命名为 `max_time`，也不会将 `simulation.integration_method` 重命名为 `time_integration_method`。"

