msgstr "`time_integration_method`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Transport time-integration method: `euler`, `implicit_midpoint`, or `crank_nicolson`, the allowed values of `transport.numerical.time_integration_method`, whose value is used when the key is unset. Another value raises `ValueError` at construction. It is passed to Functors whose `forward()` declares `time_integration_method`."
msgstr "输运时间积分方法：`euler`、`implicit_midpoint` 或 `crank_nicolson`，对应 `transport.numerical.time_integration_method` 允许的值；该键未设置时使用此参数的值。其他值会在构造时引发 `ValueError`。此设置传给 `forward()` 声明了 `time_integration_method` 的 Functor。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`implicit_midpoint_max_iter`, `implicit_midpoint_tolerance`"
msgstr "`implicit_midpoint_max_iter`, `implicit_midpoint_tolerance`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Iteration limit and convergence tolerance of the implicit transport steps; unset, `transport.numerical.implicit_midpoint_max_iter` and `transport.numerical.implicit_midpoint_tolerance` are used, and configured values are checked against their bounds."
msgstr "隐式输运步的迭代上限和收敛容差；未设置时使用 `transport.numerical.implicit_midpoint_max_iter` 和 `transport.numerical.implicit_midpoint_tolerance`，显式配置值按其边界验证。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`splitting_mode`"
msgstr "`splitting_mode`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Operator-splitting mode used by the execution loop."
msgstr "执行循环使用的分裂求解模式。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`strict_dependencies`"
msgstr "`strict_dependencies`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Escalate dependency and ordinary output-overlap conflicts where supported."
msgstr "在支持的情况下，升级依赖关系和普通输出重叠冲突。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`conservation_checks`"
msgstr "`conservation_checks`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`True` or `False` enables conservation accounting in the runtime commit path; a mapping may set only the StateManager keys `enabled`, `raise_on_violation`, `rollback_on_failure` (each `True` or `False`) and `tolerance`. Another type, an unknown key, or an invalid value raises `ValueError` naming the key and the value."
msgstr "`True` 或 `False` 在运行时提交路径中启用守恒核算；映射只能设置 StateManager 的 `enabled`、`raise_on_violation`、`rollback_on_failure`（各为 `True` 或 `False`）以及 `tolerance`。其他类型、未知键或无效值会抛出 `ValueError`，并指出键和值。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`conservation_raise_on_violation`, `conservation_rollback_on_failure`"
msgstr "`conservation_raise_on_violation`, `conservation_rollback_on_failure`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Set `raise_on_violation` and `rollback_on_failure` of that mapping. Only `True` or `False` is accepted; a string such as `\"false\"` or an integer `0`/`1` raises `ValueError`, and a value that contradicts the same key in `conservation_checks` raises."
msgstr "设置该映射的 `raise_on_violation` 和 `rollback_on_failure`。仅接受 `True` 或 `False`；`\"false\"` 这样的字符串或整数 `0`/`1` 会引发 `ValueError`；若值与 `conservation_checks` 中的同名键冲突，也会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "`conservation_tolerance`"
msgstr "`conservation_tolerance`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Explicit override of the StateManager commit-time ledger tolerance, whose default is `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance`. It must be a finite real number within the bounds declared for that parameter (currently `[1e-10, 1e-3]`); any other value raises `ValueError` naming the key and the value."
msgstr "显式覆盖 StateManager 提交时账本容差，其默认值为 `validation.conservation.conservation_tolerance`。必须是位于该参数声明边界内的有限实数（当前为 `[1e-10, 1e-3]`）；其他值会引发 `ValueError`，并指出键和值。"

