#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/configuration_and_parameters.md
msgid "Inclusive admissible interval (required): a numeric `dtype` writes an unbounded side as `-inf` or `inf` (in YAML `-.inf` / `.inf`), and `None` (`null`) states that no interval applies, which is accepted only for a non-numeric `dtype` such as a text value, a boolean switch, a list or a mapping. Numeric endpoints, values, and defaults must be YAML numbers (`1.0e+7`, `1.0e-6`); text such as `1.0e7` or `1e-6` is rejected without conversion."
msgstr "包含端点的允许区间（必填）：数值 `dtype` 将无界的一侧写为 `-inf` 或 `inf`（YAML 中为 `-.inf` / `.inf`）；`None`（`null`）表示不适用区间，仅非数值 `dtype`（如文本值、布尔开关、列表或映射）可使用。数值端点、值和默认值必须为 YAML 数字（`1.0e+7`、`1.0e-6`）；`1.0e7` 或 `1e-6` 这样的文本会直接被拒绝，不执行转换。"

